/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (Reconstruction\040of\040nonuniformly\040sampled\040bandlimited\040signals\040by\040means\040of\040time\055varying\040discrete\055time\040FIR\040filters)
/Author (Håkan\040Johansson\054\040Per\040Löwenborg)
/Subject (This\040paper\040deals\040with\040reconstruction\040of\040nonuniformly\040sampled\040bandlimited\040continuous\055time\040signals\040using\040time\055varying\040discrete\055time\040finite\055length\040impulse\040response\040\050FIR\051\040filters\056\040The\040main\040theme\040of\040the\040paper\040is\040to\040show\040how\040a\040slight\040oversampling\040should\040be\040utilized\040for\040designing\040the\040reconstruction\040filters\040in\040a\040proper\040manner\056\040Based\040on\040a\040time\055frequency\040function\054\040it\040is\040shown\040that\040the\040reconstruction\040problem\040can\040be\040posed\040as\040one\040that\040resembles\040an\040ordinary\040filter\040design\040problem\054\040both\040for\040deterministic\040signals\040and\040random\040processes\056\040From\040this\040facts\054\040an\040analytic\040least\055square\040design\040technique\040is\040then\040derived\056\040Furthermore\054\040for\040an\040important\040special\040case\054\040corresponding\040to\040periodic\040nonuniform\040sampling\054\040it\040is\040shown\040that\040the\040reconstruction\040problem\040alternatively\040can\040be\040posed\040as\040a\040filter\040bank\040design\040problem\054\040thus\040with\040requirements\040on\040a\040distortion\040transfer\040function\040and\040a\040number\040of\040aliasing\040transfer\040functions\056\040This\040eases\040the\040design\040and\040offers\040alternative\040practical\040design\040methods\040as\040discussed\040in\040the\040paper\056\040Several\040design\040examples\040are\040included\040that\040illustrate\040the\040benefits\040of\040the\040proposed\040design\040techniques\040over\040previously\040existing\040techniques\056)
/Keywords (01\040Jan\0402006\054\040EURASIP\040Journal\040on\040Advances\040in\040Signal\040Processing\054\040Filter\040design\054\040Digital\040filter\054\040Filter\040bank\054\040Aliasing\054\040Oversampling\054\040Linköping\040University)
>>
endobj
